---------------------------------------------------------------------------

在遵守本授權書所有條件的前提下，任何人均可免費為下列「非商業目的」使
用、複製、修改、合併、散布本軟體：

Subject to all terms of this license, any person may, free of charge, use,
copy, modify, merge, and distribute the Software for the following
non-commercial purposes:

  (a) 個人學習、研究、教學、評估；
      Personal study, research, teaching, and evaluation;
  (b) 非營利組織為其內部運作之使用；
      Use by non-profit organizations for their internal operations;
  (c) 為本專案提交修改、修補、提案或衍生作品（pull request、fork、
      公開展示等）；
      Submission of modifications, patches, proposals, or derivative
      works back to this project (pull requests, forks, public
      demonstrations, etc.);
  (d) 學術或技術文章中之引用與展示。
      Citation and demonstration in academic or technical writings.

