3. 禁止之使用 / Prohibited Use
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

未經原作者 Ian Xu 事前書面同意，禁止下列任何形式的「商業使用」：

The following forms of "commercial use" are prohibited without the prior
written consent of the original author, Ian Xu:

  (a) 為自身或第三方提供以本軟體（或其衍生作品）為核心的付費分析、
      顧問、SaaS、API、訂閱、或其他付費服務；
      Providing paid analysis, consulting, SaaS, API, subscription, or
      any other paid service that uses the Software (or any derivative)
      as its core;
  (b) 將本軟體或其衍生作品內嵌入任何販售之產品、服務、訓練資料、
      或商業 AI 平台；
      Embedding the Software or derivatives into any product, service,
      training dataset, or commercial AI platform that is sold;
  (c) 在營利組織內部以本軟體取代付費工具，且該使用為該組織核心營
      收業務之一部分。一般員工為公司內部生產力之非核心使用不在此限。
      Replacing paid tools with the Software inside a for-profit
      organization, where such use is part of that organization's core
      revenue-generating business. Ordinary employee productivity use
      that is not part of the core business is not restricted.

「商業使用」涵蓋直接或間接以本軟體獲取金錢、加密貨幣或同等價值之
任何活動。

"Commercial use" includes any activity that directly or indirectly
derives monetary, cryptocurrency, or equivalent value from the Software.

